{
	"version": 1,
	"_help": "Boss zombies (Skillz). Cadence comes from Difficulty.boss_* (data/difficulty.json). Boss rework (playtest #15, 2026-10-22): HP is TTK-driven, not a multiple of zombie HP: HP = ref_dps(round) x ttk x tuning.dps_eff x Difficulty.boss.hp_mult (= TTK mult) x multi_boss_hp[count] x party hp factor, ref_dps(n) = tuning.ref_dps_base + ref_dps_per_round*n (what a competent player sustains on a boss; see /workspace/skillz/BOSS_REWORK.md). Attack damage = bosses[id].damage[attack] (fraction of tuning.player_ref_hp=100) x round slope x Difficulty.boss.damage_mult x Frenzy. stages = HP-fraction thresholds (stage = thresholds crossed). Frenzy (soft enrage) starts enrage_timer s x Difficulty.boss.enrage_mult after the fight starts. Kill points = points_per_kill * kill_points_mult (Economy v2: 25 base). gravemark_reward is an int for the Gravemark currency. Echo adds use echo_* and pay no Gravemark. Spawn roster: BossCatalog.pick_roster(round, difficulty_id).",
	"default_points_per_kill": 25,
	"tuning": {
		"_help": "ref_dps = sustained boss DPS of one competent player at round n (rifle/SMG class weapons at the round's item power incl. headshots, reloads/ammo swaps NOT included: dps_eff covers dodging, reloads, add-killing). player_ref_hp = Player.max_health used to turn damage fractions into numbers. Co-op: hp_per_extra = boss HP +x per extra player; adds_per_extra = add count +x per extra player; cooldown_cut_per_extra = attack cooldowns -x per extra player (floor cooldown_floor). multi_boss_hp = per-boss HP factor when a round spawns 2/3 bosses (Hard). adds_cap_base/adds_cap_per_extra/adds_cap_max = max living boss adds. damage_round_slope = +x damage per round beyond 10 (min damage_round_floor).",
		"ref_dps_base": 70.0,
		"ref_dps_per_round": 4.5,
		"dps_eff": 0.8,
		"player_ref_hp": 100,
		"hp_per_extra": 0.85,
		"adds_per_extra": 0.5,
		"cooldown_cut_per_extra": 0.05,
		"cooldown_floor": 0.75,
		"multi_boss_hp": {
			"1": 1.0,
			"2": 0.7,
			"3": 0.55
		},
		"adds_cap_base": 6,
		"adds_cap_per_extra": 2,
		"adds_cap_max": 12,
		"damage_round_slope": 0.015,
		"damage_round_floor": 0.7,
		"frenzy_warning": 12.0,
		"budgets": {
			"_help": "Targets for a competent player (sim bot: 0.30 s reaction, ~80% duty): ttk = fight length in s, damage = raw damage taken before regen (player 100 HP, regen 6/s after 4 s). Verified by tests/boss_sim.gd.",
			"easy": {
				"ttk_min": 50,
				"ttk_max": 85,
				"damage_max": 170
			},
			"medium": {
				"ttk_min": 65,
				"ttk_max": 110,
				"damage_max": 230
			},
			"hard": {
				"ttk_min": 80,
				"ttk_max": 135,
				"damage_max": 300
			}
		},
